# joy: one reading of the game port, where no joystick is: on Bochs and
# MAME. DOSBox-X's centred stick reads 684 to 687 us, as its polling falls;
# devices/calls.test checks it there.
program: shell
emulators: bochs mame
keys: joy\n
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>joy
buttons: none; axes: absent absent absent absent
A:\>
